PS5 Full Jailbreak Chain via WebKit (0 to 100) — ARCHIVE OF ALL STEPS TO HV
================================================================================
Firmware: 14.10 | Kernel: FreeBSD r230171 (Sep 28 2026) | WebKit ~= Safari 17.0
Archive maintained per research goal. Last full update: 2026-11-10.
Sources: docs/WEBKIT_RESEARCH_LOG.md, docs/WEBKIT_PRIMITIVE_RETRACTION.md,
